@startuml
title State machine for Ott Based System Mini Reel

[*] --> AccountCreation

state "Account Created" as AccountCreated <<choice>>
AccountCreated : entry / User created an account
AccountCreated : do / Initialize user profile

state WatchingVideos {
  state ViewingVideo
  state SavingVideo
  state Discussing
}

WatchingVideos --> ViewingVideo : Start Watching Video
ViewingVideo --> SavingVideo : Save Video to Likes List
SavingVideo --> ViewingVideo : View Another Video
ViewingVideo --> Discussing : Enter Discussion Option
Discussing --> ViewingVideo : Exit Discussion

AccountCreated --> WatchingVideos : Watch Videos After Account Created

WatchingVideos --> [*] : Log Out or Delete Account

@enduml
